Package: com.saihgupr.remotecompanion
Name: RemoteCompanion
Depends: mobilesubstrate
Version: 3.6.3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: A modern Activator replacement for rootless and rootful jailbreaks. Bind triggers like Touch ID, Power/Volume buttons, and Status Bar gestures to system actions, Siri automation, and custom TCP commands. Supports arm64 and arm64e devices across iOS 14+. https://github.com/saihgupr/RemoteCompanion
